    "method":  "Re-express the M103 minimum/median ideal-roof rise thresholds as inequalities in unknown eave elevation, finished-floor elevation and scalar eave build-down. For each conditional room/case, the combined inequality is z_eave - z_finished_floor \u003e= max(5 - minimumRise, 7 - medianRise) + b_eave. No value is supplied for any variable.",
